From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlmarionAI <150292831+AlmarionAI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:04:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [principal] sealed agent identity and fail-closed principal
 gate

Add GUC_SEALED, a core GUC flag enforced in set_config_with_handle(): a
sealed variable holding a value refuses every assignment and reset, and
may only be established by the connected session itself (never by a
role/database default, the command line, the environment or the startup
packet).

Add agent_id (text, GUC_SEALED), current_agent(), and the PGC_SUSET
switch agent_require_principal, which makes standard_ExecutorStart refuse
any plan while no principal is sealed. Bump MAX_GUC_FLAGS 6 -> 7 to match
the push sites in pg_settings_get_flags. Regression test agent_identity.
